    <bpmn2:textAnnotation id="Annotation_0">
      <bpmn2:text>Entrypoint functions: _resolve_self, _resolve_framework_src
Shared helpers: red, yellow, green, say, fm_scalar, fm_list, fm_h1, fm_block_list, fm_block_extract, fm_block_replace
Shared and cross-flow variables: BASE_DIR, BASE_FRAMEWORK_SRC, BIN, DEFAULT_FRAMEWORK, DEST, DOT_LLM_DIR, FRAMEWORK_SRC, FRAMEWORKS_DIR, INTAKE_DESC, INTAKE_RELATES, INTAKE_STATUS, INTAKE_SUMMARY, INTAKE_TYPE, INTAKE_TYPE_RAW, QUIET, REPO, SCHEMA, SCRIPT_DIR, SKILLS_SRC, SRC</bpmn2:text>
    </bpmn2:textAnnotation>
    <bpmn2:textAnnotation id="Annotation_1">
      <bpmn2:text>Call relationships and exact source lines are listed in function-inventory.md. Command tasks represent module boundaries; each annotation lists every function owned by that module.</bpmn2:text>
    </bpmn2:textAnnotation>
